abstract: >-
  Software accompanying the manuscript "Physics-informed and hybrid residual-learning
  models for deep formation temperature prediction in the Sichuan Basin: benchmarking
  against physics-based and machine-learning methods." The repository implements the
  layered conductive baseline, surrogate-assisted thermophysical calibration, a
  physics-informed neural network, hybrid PINN-XGBoost residual correction, and SHAP
  interpretation used in the unified benchmark.
